' BOARD GAMES
' Three board games (Checkers, Reversi, Awari) from Tim Hartnell's Giant Book of Computer Games
' (Ballantine Books, 1984; Interface Publications, 1983) on one
' ColecoVision cartridge, in Amy by Amy Bienvenu.
'
' The games themselves are ../rv (Reversi), ../ck (Checkers) and ../aw
' (Awari); build.py joins them. See their sources for the rules, controls and liberties.
' Here: a first menu picks the game; each game's title has OTHER GAME to
' come back to it. Keypad not used.

